  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into sticks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook zucchini in batches, turning, until tender, 2-4 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Set aside to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fef9fbba6118bd6bcbbf51/step-498f9100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.Transfer to a plate to rest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fef9fbba6118bd6bcbbf51/step-a9e31d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the steak is resting, slice lemon into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine harissa paste, Greek-style yoghurt and a squeeze of lemon juice.\n• To the bowl with zucchini, add rocket leaves and a generous squeeze of lemon juice, toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fef9fbba6118bd6bcbbf51/step-2db94a20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide haloumi and charred zucchini salad between plates.\n• Sprinkle roasted almonds over salad. Serve with harissa yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fef9fbba6118bd6bcbbf51/step-2ab03030.jpg"
    }
  ]
